CHAPTER.VERS:
How weak is thy heart, saith the Lord 
        GOD, seeing thou doest all these , the work of an imperious 
        harlot;

In that thou buildest thy eminent place in the head of every way, and makest thy high place in every street; and hast not been as an harlot, in that thou scornest 
        hire; 

          In that thou buildest…: or, In thy daughters is thine, etc

Thus saith the Lord 
        GOD; Because thy filthiness was poured out, and thy nakedness 
        uncovered through thy harlotries with thy lovers, and with all the idols of thy abominations, and by the blood of thy children, which thou didst give to them;
